    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n100973" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συντεκμαίρομαι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>conjecture from signs</i> or
				<i>symptoms</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Prog.</u>
				2
			</span></i>; <i>examine carefully</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Aph.</u>
				1.9
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συντεκμηράμενοι ἡνίκ᾽ ἂν
				ᾤοντο . . </span>
			<i>calculating the time</i> when . . , <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				7.1.15
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξυντεκμηράμενοι</span>
			<i>having calculated the distance</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				2.76
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Smp.</u>
				2.8
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>take into account also</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν δύναμιν τοῦ φαρμάκου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sever.
					<u>Clyst.</u>
					42
				</span></i>
			.</div>
